          ],
          "duration": "One scene",
          "notes": [
            "The vampire can tap into one, some, or all of the target’s senses.",
            "The user retains their own perceptions and remains aware of their surroundings.",
            "Using the power on a stranger requires line of sight to initiate.",
            "The power can be used over longer distances on someone who still has some of the user’s Blood in their body.",
            "Sense the Unseen can allow the target to notice the intrusion."
          ],
          "sources": [
