          ],
          "duration": "One turn",
          "notes": "By touching an inanimate object or the ground at a location, the vampire can sense the emotional residue left by those who have handled that object or visited the location in the past. The user gains insight into not only that person, but also what was done and under what circumstances.",
          "sources": [
