          "dice_pools": [
            "Resolve + Auspex vs Resolve + Intelligence"
          ],
          "duration": "Until ended, voluntarily or involuntarily.",
          "notes": [
            "The vampire can do anything and go anywhere the subject could while the power remains active.",
            "The power allows the vampire to experience sunlight, food, and physical sexuality through the host.",
            "The victim’s mind remains hidden to the vampire.",
            "Possession violates the victim profoundly; the Storyteller should consider awarding Stains.",
            "A total failure makes the victim immune to further Possession attempts for the duration of the story.",
            "Aggravated damage to the subject can end the possession.",
            "If the subject dies during Possession, the vampire suffers three levels of Aggravated damage to Willpower."
          ],
          "sources": [
