          ],
          "duration": "Roughly one minute per Rouse Check. Increased to a full scene on consenting subjects.",
          "notes": [
            "Thought projection requires line of sight but no dice roll.",
            "Reading a consenting mortal requires no roll.",
            "Reading a non-consenting vampire requires spending one Willpower before the roll.",
            "Higher margin allows access to more distant or buried memories.",
            "A critical win reveals a coherent picture of the subject’s current thoughts and intentions."
          ],
          "sources": [
